# Base URL for the Exodus backend API.
#
# Local dev:  http://localhost:3000/api   (see .env.local)
# Production: point this at the backend's HTTPS domain, e.g.
#             https://api.your-domain.com/api/exodus
#
# NOTE: When the frontend is deployed to Vercel (HTTPS), this MUST be an
# HTTPS URL. A plain-HTTP backend (e.g. http://13.214.26.96/...) will be
# blocked by the browser as mixed content, so the app loads but every API
# call fails. Get TLS on the backend (domain + cert) and repoint this here.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
